            "review_title": "Review at KING BBQ Hoan Kiem Lake",
            "review_text": "Lisado976\nSan Jose, California234 contributions\n0\nGood foods excellent service\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nThe quality of the foods here is good, but less varieties than the one we visited in Ho Chi Minh city a year ago. We have the buffet option that gave us both the BBQ grilled meat as well as the hotpot. The meats were good, but the side dish and dessert options were somewhat limited. The server grilled the meats and cut them into bit size pieces for us, so 5 stars for the service. All the severs there were very friendly, attentative and always willing to please. We had the Thai soup base for our hotpot and it tasted very authentic and delicious. I would have giving this restaurant a 5 stars rating if there were more side dish and dessert options. Overall we had a great experience and recommend this restaurant.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 17, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
