            "review_title": "Review at KING BBQ Hoan Kiem Lake",
            "review_text": "moviegeekjn\nPhoenix, Arizona2611 contributions\n0\nSatisfying\nNov 2017 • Couples\nWe ate here our last night in Hanoi and were satisfied. The price is moderate and you can eat as many buffet items as you please while having a few Korean BBQ dishes. Many of the items are tasty, so be selective with your choices.\n\nAs usual in Vietnam, it will be difficult to communicate with the staff in English. But we were eventually able to understand how their system worked and not get shocked at the end with an exorbitant bill.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 27, 2017",
