            "review_text": "turtle63\nBlenheim, New Zealand280 contributions\n0\nDidnt know what to expect\nSep 2017 • Couples\nWe decided to come here a few night s before we came as it looked very interesting.\nWe are from NZ so it looked a bit our of our depth but we came anyway.\nFrom the moment we walked in till we left we were treated very well and things were explained to us very well.\nso we ordered and then they cam and cooked it our table with the charcoal cooker in the middle. now that was an experience and we totally enjoyed the flavours of everything together.\nThe meat/chicken were both cooked beautifully and the pickles to go with it all were awesome and added so much flavour to the dish.\nWe recommended this place to some people at the bottom of the building and hope they went and enjoyed it as much as we did. Thanks very much\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 27, 2017",
